msgid "Logický model pro prenatální a perinatální údaje relevantní především u dětských pacientů."
msgstr "Antenatal and perinatal information, particularly relevant to paediatric patients."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData/short
msgid "Prenatální / perinatální data"
msgstr "Antenatal and perinatal data"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData/definition
msgid "Údaje o prenatálním a perinatálním období. 
Používají se pouze, pokud jsou relevantní (yes/no). Pro dospělé pacienty se sekce nevyplňuje. 
Poznámka ze Scalesoft: pokud není relevantní, sekce zmizí celá."
msgstr "Údaje o prenatálním a perinatálním období. 
Používají se pouze, pokud jsou relevantní (yes/no). Pro dospělé pacienty se sekce nevyplňuje. 
Poznámka ze Scalesoft: pokud není relevantní, sekce zmizí celá."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.prenatalniMalformace/short
msgid "Prenatálně zjištěná malformace"
msgstr "5.1 Anomaly Detected Antenatally"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.prenatalniMalformace/definition
msgid "Informace o malformacích zjištěných prenatálně. Hodnoty: No / Unique / Multiple."
msgstr "Indicate if any structural or functional foetal anomaly was detected during antenatal imaging or screening (amniotic fluid anomaly, umbilical cord anomaly, foetal anomaly, etc.).\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory and is only to be completed if relevant.\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: No / Unique / Multiple\n\n•\tNo: no anomalies were detected during antenatal screening.\n•\tSingle: a single abnormality was detected during antenatal screening.\n•\tMultiple: several abnormalities were detected during antenatal screening."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.lekarAssReprodukce/short
msgid "Lékařsky asistovaná reprodukce"
msgstr "5.2 Medically Assisted Procreation"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.lekarAssReprodukce/definition
msgid "Zda bylo těhotenství výsledkem lékařsky asistované reprodukce. Hodnoty: Yes / No / N/A."
msgstr "Was the patient conceived through a medically assisted reproduction programme?\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory and is only to be completed if relevant.\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\n•\thttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.gestacniVek/short
