msgstr "5.3 Gestational Age at Birth"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.gestacniVek/definition
msgid "Gestační věk v týdnech (weeks), kdy došlo k narození. Hodnoty mohou obsahovat i možnost N/A."
msgstr "Completed weeks + days at time of delivery (e.g., 38+4 weeks).\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory and is only to be completed if relevant.\n\nThe recommended data standard is EHDSCurrentPregnancy.gestationalAge\n•\thttps://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/0.2.1/StructureDefinition-EHDSCurrentPregnancy-definitions.html#key_EHDSCurrentPregnancy.gestationalAge\n"

