#: StructureDefinition.element.LogPrenatalDataCz.prenatalniData.foetopatologie/definition
msgid "Informace o zjištěné foetopatologii. Hodnoty: Yes / No."
msgstr "Indicate whether a foetal pathological examination (post-termination or stillbirth) was performed.\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory and is only to be completed if relevant. It applies to deceased foetal cases.\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\n•\thttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html\n"

